\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. A little child may know
\par Our Father's name of Love;
\par 'Tis written on the earth below,
\par And on the sky above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Around me when I look,
\par His handiwork I see;
\par This world is like a picture book
\par To teach His name to me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 3. The thousand little flowers
\par Within our garden found,
\par The rainbow and the soft spring showers,
\par And every pleasant  sound.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The birds that sweetly sing,
\par The moon that shines by night;
\par With every tiny living thing
\par Rejoicing in the light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. And every star above,
\par Set in the blue sky,
\par All tell me that our God is love,
\par All tell me He is nigh.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

